<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
    <meta name="description" content="Illustrative examples of the pet transport experience with <%= business.name %>.">
    <title>Customer Reviews | <%= business.name %></title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/img/favicon.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/slicknav.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/custom.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/reviews.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="/css/brand.css" rel="stylesheet">
<%- include('../partials/chat') %>
<link href="/css/zoom.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/site-header') %>
    <div class="page-header"><div class="container"><div class="page-header-box"><h2>Customer Reviews</h2><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="breadcrumb"><li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li><li>Reviews</li></ol></nav></div></div></div>

    <main class="reviews-page">
        <div class="container">
            <section class="reviews-intro">
                <div class="reviews-kicker">Illustrative service feedback</div>
                <h1>Examples of the service experience</h1>
                <p>Illustrative examples of what families can expect when moving a pet with us: careful planning, clear guidance and updates at every stage. These are examples, not reviews from named customers.</p>
            </section>

            <div class="row reviews-grid justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><article class="review-card"><div class="review-card-header"><div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div><span class="review-service">Pet Transport</span></div><blockquote><p>The guidance made the crate, documents, and veterinary preparations easier to understand. Regular communication helped us feel more prepared for the journey.</p></blockquote><div class="review-name"><span class="review-initials">CR</span><h2>Claire R.</h2></div></article></div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><article class="review-card"><div class="review-card-header"><div class="review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i></div><span class="review-service">Pet Transport</span></div><blockquote><p>The team paid close attention to our pet’s needs and checked the pickup and receiving arrangements carefully. We understood what would happen at each stage.</p></blockquote><div class="review-name"><span class="review-initials">NS</span><h2>Noah S.</h2></div></article></div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><article class="review-card"><div class="review-card-header"><div class="review-stars" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-regular fa-star"></i></div><span class="review-service">Pet Transport</span></div><blockquote><p>It helped to understand which steps belonged to the pet travel team, our veterinarian, and the airline. That clarity made our travel preparations easier.</p></blockquote><div class="review-name"><span class="review-initials">ZP</span><h2>Zoe P.</h2></div></article></div>
            </div>

            <section class="reviews-cta"><div><h2>Ready to plan your pet's journey?</h2><p>Tell us about your pet and route, and we'll recommend the safest way to travel.</p></div><a href="/quote" class="btn-default">Get a Free Quote</a></section>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/site-footer') %>
    
    <script src="/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/jquery.slicknav.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/service-navigation.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
